msgstr "若lí想beh自訂桌面頂ê「網路服侍器」標á ê名，通佇tsia設定。"

#: libcaja-private/org.mate.caja.gschema.xml:453
msgid ""
"An integer specifying how parts of overlong file names should be replaced by"
